like_count": 0}, {"author": "van.ngoac", "author_id": "69789372498", "id": "18085847855278363", "text": "Nine slices if I have to guess before watching the tutorial", "timestamp": 1789076584, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "floppabyssalmon", "author_id": "2025438773", "id": "17946089985319593", "text": "If only I had seen this earlier \ud83d\ude2d would have saved me sooo much time \ud83d\ude2d", "timestamp": 1788690754, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "m_hylrie", "author_id": "18905034271", "id": "18112362215516207", "text": "I remember learning this technique because Geometry Dash uses it lol", "timestamp": 1787179240, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "muzlik__gm", "author_id": "70827306388", "id": "18110846581983887", "text": "Aside from everything, Isadora Looks very cute there! \ud83d\ude02", "timestamp": 1784571069, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "a.j.r._.uribe", "author_id": "63656624672", "id": "18106530589826892", "text": "It would be cooler if there was a repeating mode for nine slice instead of just stretching it cause when you want to put some cluster pixels in the parts that stretch they still distort", "timestamp": 1783046832, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "sori.jr11", "author_id": "54651311811", "id": "18082879904346818", "text": "idleon mentioned, top tier reel", "timestamp": 1782469064, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "madmaniac_360", "author_id": "59057449047", "id": "18099608678173781", "text": "But... I can see the pixel stretch on the edge...", "timestamp": 1782087786, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "imaginaig", "author_id": "25523692588", "id": "18095726057218707", "text": "I had always wondered about this, it's so simple", "timestamp": 1781731127, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "silk.yson.g", "author_id": "77154103182", "id": "18066087029443151", "text": "Will I ever make a video game? Probably not. Do I watch every single one of those mini tutorials? Hell yeah.", "timestamp": 1781681685, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "stormytunaa", "author_id": "3810855271", "id": "18094249442217094", "text": "nine slice panels my beloved. if you were curious, they aren't complicated to program yourself either, I've been using them for UI in my terraria mods for ages", "timestamp": 1781672432, "like_count": 39}, {"author": "fuckutoast", "author_id": "10985831589", "id": "18059417078725575", "text": "Doesn\u2019t just apply to menus, I learned this technique while making an smw rom hack and have used it a lot for the level\u2019s tile sets and it ended up being a lot more satisfying than I thought it would be when you get it down just right", "timestamp": 1781667371, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "izemwestan", "author_id": "47462432543", "id": "17891544516544898", "text": "This is basically how old games used to do it, like PS1 games I hack their menus are like that", "timestamp": 1781666881, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DZqZpQbtQ79/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DZqZpQbtQ79/", "webpage_url_basename": "DZqZpQbtQ79", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/724795335_17979412311013840_2453975144714485627_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=MzkyMTA1OTIxMTg4NTQ4MTcyNTE3OTc5NDEyMzA4MDEzODQw.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=8G4POtConX0Q7kNvwHbyrOH&_nc_oc=AdojCWw5ciI92bmvIbZHHCdlHfYJoB_EOqqrONXLJpYYZ9G8cUCFpAfJyMKgUDTe0X0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=6KF1acG7hd4HhFPcjcS8HQ&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQR39sDtPNnI6UOEGxs7b8cr-zU5Q4e3gYGYA0wi-nMnGw&oe=6AE89608", "display_id": "DZqZpQbtQ79", "fulltitle": "Video by inboundshovel", "upload_date": "20260616", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793244042, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.co